claim.claim-text:
an external container;
an internal container disposed inside the external container;
a plunger body disposed inside the internal container;
a sensor module disposed below the plunger body;
a needle withdrawing body disposed inside the plunger body;
a needle coupled to the needle withdrawing body;
an elastic plunger spring which is coupled to the plunger body and extended to move the plunger body and the sensor module downward within the internal container; and
a needle withdrawing elastic spring which is coupled to the needle withdrawing body and extended to move the needle withdrawing body and the needle upward,
wherein a top end portion of the elastic plunger spring is in contact with an inner top surface of the internal container.

an external container;
an internal container disposed inside the external container;
a plunger body disposed inside the internal container;
a sensor module disposed below the plunger body;
a needle withdrawing body disposed inside the plunger body;
a needle coupled to the needle withdrawing body;
an elastic plunger spring which is coupled to the plunger body and extended to move the plunger body and the sensor module downward within the internal container; and
a needle withdrawing elastic spring which is coupled to the needle withdrawing body and extended to move the needle withdrawing body and the needle upward,
wherein a press button for extending the elastic plunger spring is formed on a side surface of the external container.
